>Supplemental text, etc.</p></div>The text picks up after the fixed feature.<p></p><p>Here is a fixed feature containing a single unique featureFixeName and a main title,which both should display. The featureFixedName title should appear before the maintitle.</p><div id=\"c12-feafxd-0003\" class=\"feature\">Concept Checktf09feafxd0003 Additional Work<p>Some text.</p></div>The text picks up after the fixed feature.<p></p><p>Here is a fixed feature containing a two unique featureFixeNames, one of which shoulddisplay (Concept Check) and on which should not (Exhibit).</p><div id=\"c12-feafxd-0004\" class=\"feature\">Concept Check<p>tf09feafxd0004 Some text.</p></div>The text picks up after the fixed feature.<p></p><p>Here is a fixed feature containing two unique featureFixeNames, which both shoulddisplay in the order they are given.</p><div id=\"c12-feafxd-0005\" class=\"feature\">Concept CheckDid You Know?<p>tf09feafxd0005 Some text.</p></div>The text picks up after the fixed feature.<p></p></div><div id=\"c12-sec-0200\" class=\"article-section__content\"><h2 id=\"c12-sec-0200-title\" class=\"article-section__title section__title\">4 featureFixed with icons</h2><p>Here is a fixed feature containing a single unique feature fixed name, which has anicon associated with it. Only the icon should display.</p><div id=\"c12-feafxd-0200\" class=\"feature\"><h3><span class=\"feature-label\">Do it!</span></h3><p>tf09ffxdicon0001 Some text.</p></div>The text picks up after the fixed feature.<p></p><p>Here is a fixed feature containing a single unique feature fixed name, which has anicon associated with it. Only the icon should display for QA and online versions ofthe content.</p><div id=\"c12-feafxd-0201\" class=\"feature\"><h3><span class=\"feature-label\">The Navigator</span></h3><p>tf09ffxdicon0002 Some text.</p><p>Supplemental text, etc.</p></div>The text picks up after the fixed feature.<p></p><p>Here is a fixed feature containing a single unique feature fixed name, which has anicon associated with it. Only the icon should display for QA and print versions ofthe content.</p><div id=\"c12-feafxd-0202\" class=\"feature\"><h3><span class=\"feature-label\">International</span></h3><p>tf09ffxdicon0003 Some text.</p></div>The text picks up after the fixed feature.<p></p><p>Here is a fixed feature containing two unique feature fixed names, one of which hasjust an icon and one that has an icon and text. Both should appear in all renderings.</p><div id=\"c12-feafxd-0203\" class=\"feature\">Investing<p>tf09ffxdicon0004 Some text.</p></div>The text picks up after the fixed feature.<p></p></div><div id=\"c12-sec-0030\" class=\"article-section__content\"><h2 id=\"c12-sec-0030-title\" class=\"article-section__title section__title\">5 displayedItem</h2><p>The displayed equation below should appear after this line of text. It has the mathelement, so all text within should display accordingly. It is numbered 1:</p><div class=\"inline-equation\"><span class=\"inline-equation__construct\"><!-- FIGURE--><!-- ${MathJax: TeX-AMS-MML_HTMLorMML}--><span style=\"display: none;\" class=\"MathJax_Preview\"></span><div style=\"text-align: left;\" class=\"MathJax_Display\"><span id=\"MathJax-Element-2-Frame\" tabindex=\"0\" data-mathml=\"&lt;math xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&quot; display=&quot;block&quot;&gt;&lt;msubsup&gt;&lt;mi&gt;tf09disp0001&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mn&gt;A&lt;/mn&gt;&lt;mn&gt;R&lt;/mn&gt;&lt;/msubsup&gt;&lt;mtext&gt;.&lt;/mtext&gt;&lt;/math&gt;\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"text-align: left; position: relative;\" class=\"MathJax\"><nobr aria-hidden=\"true\"><span id=\"MathJax-Span-7\" style=\"width: 7.843em; display: inline-block;\" class=\"math\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 6.319em; height: 0px; font-size: 124%;\"><span style=\"position: absolute; clip: rect(1.481em 1006.23em 2.914em -999.998em); top: -2.507em; left: 0em;\"><span id=\"MathJax-Span-8\" class=\"mrow\"><span id=\"MathJax-Span-9\" class=\"msubsup\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 5.871em; height: 0px;\"><span style=\"position: absolute; clip: rect(3.183em 1005.15em 4.348em -999.998em); top: -3.985em; left: 0em;\"><span id=\"MathJax-Span-10\" style=\"font-family: STIXGeneral;\" class=\"mi\">tf09disp0001</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 3.99em;\"></span></span><span style=\"position: absolute; clip: rect(3.407em 1000.54em 4.124em -999.998em); top: -4.388em; left: 5.289em;\"><span id=\"MathJax-Span-11\" style=\"font-size: 70.7%; font-family: STIXGeneral;\" class=\"mn\">R</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 3.99em;\"></span></span><span style=\"position: absolute; clip: rect(3.362em 1000.59em 4.124em -999.998em); top: -3.716em; left: 5.289em;\"><span id=\"MathJax-Span-12\" style=\"font-size: 70.7%; font-family: STIXGeneral;\" class=\"mn\">A</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 3.99em;\"></span></span></span></span><span id=\"MathJax-Span-13\" style=\"font-family: STIXGeneral; padding-left: 0.181em;\" class=\"mtext\">.</span></span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 2.511em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; vertical-align: -0.386em; border-left: 0px solid; width: 0px; height: 1.503em;\"></span></span></nobr><span role=\"presentation\" class=\"MJX_Assistive_MathML MJX_Assistive_MathML_Block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><msubsup><mi>tf09disp0001</mi><mn>A</mn><mn>R</mn></msubsup><mtext>.</mtext></math></span></span></div></span><span id=\"c12-disp-0010\" class=\"inline-equation__label\">(1)</span></div>Space should appear before and after the displayed equation.<p></p><p>The displayed equation below should appear after this line of text. In a QA rendering,or for systems that do not render MathML, it should display its image alternativetf09math0001:</p><div class=\"inline-equation\"><span class=\"inline-equation__construct\"><!-- EMPTY SOURCE--></span><span id=\"c12-disp-0100\" class=\"inline-equation__label\"></span></div>Space should appear before and after the displayed equation.<p></p><p>The displayed equation below should appear after this line of text. It has a p, butthe text should display as the other equations etc. within a displayed item. It isnumbered 2:</p><div class=\"inline-equation\"><span class=\"inline-equation__construct\"><!-- FIGURE--><p>ABC tf09disp0002</p></span><span id=\"c12-disp-0020\" class=\"inline-equation__label\">(2)</span></div>Space should appear before and after the displayed text.<p></p><p>The displayed item below is a chemical reaction. It has a p, but the text should displayas the other equations etc. within a displayed item. It is numbered 3:</p><div class=\"inline-equation\"><span class=\"inline-equation__construct\"><!-- FIGURE--><p>2H<sub>2</sub> + O<sub>2</sub> → H<sub>2</sub>O tf09disp0003.</p></span><span id=\"c12-disp-0030\" class=\"inline-equation__label\">(3)</span></div><p></p><p>The displayed item below presents simple text that is to be displayed similarly tothe equations. It is numbered 4:</p><p>Hydrogen + Oxygen produces Water. tf09disp0004</p><li id=\"c12-note-0101\"><span class=\"number\">1 </span>Footnote provided in displayed Item.</li>Vertical space should appear before and after the displayed text.<p></p><p>The above three displayed items <a href=\"#c12-disp-0020 #c12-disp-0030 #c12-disp-0040\" title=\"Link to equation\" class=\"equationLink scrollableLink\">2-</a> demonstrate our claims.</p><p>This displayed item is a repeat of the first one, and should be numbered 1 as well.</p><div class=\"inline-equation\"><span class=\"inline-equation__construct\"><!-- FIGURE--><!-- ${MathJax: TeX-AMS-MML_HTMLorMML}--><span style=\"display: none;\" class=\"MathJax_Preview\"></span><div style=\"text-align: left;\" class=\"MathJax_Display\"><span id=\"MathJax-Element-3-Frame\" tabindex=\"0\" data-mathml=\"&lt;math xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&quot; display=&quot;block&quot;&gt;&lt;msubsup&gt;&lt;mi&gt;tf09disp0005&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mn&gt;A&lt;/mn&gt;&lt;mn&gt;R&lt;/mn&gt;&lt;/msubsup&gt;&lt;mtext&gt;.&lt;/mtext&gt;&lt;/math&gt;\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"text-align: left; position: relative;\" class=\"MathJax\"><nobr aria-hidden=\"true\"><span id=\"MathJax-Span-14\" style=\"width: 7.843em; display: inline-block;\" class=\"math\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 6.319em; height: 0px; font-size: 124%;\"><span style=\"position: absolute; clip: rect(1.481em 1006.23em 2.914em -999.998em); top: -2.507em; left: 0em;\"><span id=\"MathJax-Span-15\" class=\"mrow\"><span id=\"MathJax-Span-16\" class=\"msubsup\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 5.871em; height: 0px;\"><span style=\"position: absolute; clip: rect(3.183em 1005.2em 4.348em -999.998em); top: -3.985em; left: 0em;\"><span id=\"MathJax-Span-17\" style=\"font-family: STIXGeneral;\" class=\"mi\">tf09disp0005</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 3.99em;\"></span></span><span style=\"position: absolute; clip: rect(3.407em 1000.54em 4.124em -999.998em); top: -4.388em; left: 5.289em;\"><span id=\"MathJax-Span-18\" style=\"font-size: 70.7%; font-family: STIXGeneral;\" class=\"mn\">R</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 3.99em;\"></span></span><span style=\"position: absolute; clip: rect(3.362em 1000.59em 4.124em -999.998em); top: -3.716em; left: 5.289em;\"><span id=\"MathJax-Span-19\" style=\"font-size: 70.7%; font-family: STIXGeneral;\" class=\"mn\">A</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 3.99em;\"></span></span></span></span><span id=\"MathJax-Span-20\" style=\"font-family: STIXGeneral; padding-left: 0.181em;\" class=\"mtext\">.</span></span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 2.511em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; vertical-align: -0.386em; border-left: 0px solid; width: 0px; height: 1.503em;\"></span></span></nobr><span role=\"presentation\" class=\"MJX_Assistive_MathML MJX_Assistive_MathML_Block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><msubsup><mi>tf09disp0005</mi><mn>A</mn><mn>R</mn></msubsup><mtext>.</mtext></math></span></span></div><a title=\"Link to note\" href=\"#c12-note-0002\" class=\"noteLink scrollableLink\">2</a></span><span id=\"c12-disp-0050\" class=\"inline-equation__label\">(4)</span></div><p></p><p>The displayed equation below has a graphic instead of text. It should be numbered5 tf09disp0006:</p><div class=\"inline-equation\"><span class=\"inline-equation__construct\"><!-- EMPTY SOURCE--></span><span id=\"c12-disp-0060\" class=\"inline-equation__label\">(5)</span></div>Space should appear before and after the displayed equation.<p></p></div><div id=\"c12-sec-0040\" class=\"article-section__content\"><h2 id=\"c12-sec-0040-title\" class=\"article-section__title section__title\">6 mathStatement</h2><div id=\"c12-sec-0050\" class=\"article-section__sub-content\"><h3 class=\"article-section__sub-title\">6.1 Theorems</h3><p>Here is a math statement with a single unique mathStatementName (Theorem), which shoulddisplay:</p><div id=\"c12-mthst-0001\" class=\"mathStatement\"><p><span class=\"mathStatement-label\">Theorem.</span>tf09mthst0001 With e chosen as above, the spanning tree has cardinality 1.</p></div>The text picks up after the math statement.<p></p><p>Here is a math statement with a single unique mathStatementName (Blue), which shouldNOT display in a customer‒facing rendering. It may appear in a non‒customer‒facingrendering but it should be clearly indicated that this title is not to appear in acustomer‒facing rendering (e.g. by having display=\"no\"):</p><div id=\"c12-mthst-0002\" class=\"mathStatement\"><p><span class=\"mathStatement-label\">Blue.</span>tf09mthst0002 With e chosen as above, the spanning tree has cardinality 2.</p></div>The text picks up after the math statement.<p></p><p>Some intervening text.</p><p>Here is a math statement containing a single unique mathStatementName and a main title,which both should display. The mathStatementName title should appear before the maintitle.</p><div id=\"c12-mthst-0003\" class=\"mathStatement\">TheoremThe Spanning Tree<p><span class=\"mathStatement-label\">.</span>tf09mthst0003 With e chosen as above, the spanning tree has cardinality 0.</p></div>The math statement below should not be labeled.<p></p><p>Here is a math statement containing two unique mathStatementNames, one of which shoulddisplay in all renderings (Theorem) and one (Blue) which should not display in a customer‒facingrendering. (Blue) may appear in a non‒customer‒facing rendering but it should be clearlyindicated that this title is not to appear in a customer‒facing rendering (e.g. byhaving display=\"no\").</p><div id=\"c12-mthst-0004\" class=\"mathStatement\">Theorem<p><span class=\"mathStatement-label\">.</span>tf09mthst0004 With e chosen as above, the spanning tree has cardinality 0.</p></div>The text picks up after the fixed feature.<p></p><p>Here is a math statement containing two unique mathStatementNames, which both shoulddisplay in the order they are given.</p><div id=\"c12-mthst-0005\" class=\"mathStatement\">TheoremDo the Math<p><span class=\"mathStatement-label\">. ([tf09mathDetail0001a see Theorem <a href=\"#c12-mthst-0001\" title=\"Link to mathStatement\" class=\"equationLink scrollableLink\">1</a> tf09mathDetail0001b])</span>With e chosen as above, the spanning tree has cardinality 0. tf09mthst0005</p></div>The text picks up after the fixed feature.<p></p></div></div><div class=\"article-section__content article-section__content-notepres\"><h2 id=\"-title\"><div class=\"article-section__title\">End Notes</div></h2><ul class=\"custom-style-list noteList\"><li id=\"c12-note-0001\"><span class=\"number\">1 </span>A note linked from a chemicalStructure.</li><li id=\"c12-note-0002\"><span class=\"number\">2 </span>A note linked from a displayedItem.</li><li id=\"c12-note-0003\"><span class=\"number\">3 </span>A note linked from a mathStatement.</li><li id=\"c12-note-0004\"><span class=\"number\">4 </span>A note containing a chemicalStructure.<div id=\"c12-cstr-0005\" class=\"figure\">tf09cstr0005 Structure in a list item.</div></li><li id=\"c12-note-0005\"><span class=\"number\">5 </span>A note containing a fixed block:<div class=\"block-box\"><p>tf09blkfxd0012 Here is simple boxed text.</p></div></li></ul></div></section></article>",
